message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the paper describing the method (see references)."
title: "tidal accelerations"
abstract: "C++ simulation of the tidal accelerations that the objects of a planetary system exert on each other, based on the Keplerian orbits of the Sun, planets, moons, asteroids, trans-Neptunian objects, and comets of the solar system, and of the extrasolar planetary system TRAPPIST-1, together with Python3 scripts reproducing the figures of Paschek et al. (2021), Appl. Sci. 11, 8624."
